parts.text:
Now: (1) no-progress tracking on tool results, (2) no-op disambiguation in layout tool text, (3) helper fn is_no_progress_text.

After tools.run in turn_loop:

```rust
let result = match tools.run(doc, name, &args).await { ... };
tool_calls += 1;
emit!(EngineEvent::ToolResult {...});
// 无进展判定
if is_no_progress_text(&result.text) {
    no_progress += 1;
    if no_progress >= MAX_NO_PROGRESS {
        stats.add(&usage, spent);
        remember!();
        return Err(format!("连续 {MAX_NO_PROGRESS} 步没有产生任何进展（no-op/失败/未变化），已中止。已完成的修改都保留在文件里。建议：把任务拆小、明确指出目标节点，或换一种问法。"));
    }
} else {
    no_progress = 0;
}
```

Insert after the ToolResult emit (line ~334 area, before parts push? The parts push happens after; abort after emit is fine — return before pushing history, history unused after abort).

Helper at module level:

```rust
/// 无进展判定：no-op / view 未变化 / 工具失败都算原地踏步的一步。
/// read/check/view(渲染成功) 算有进展（信息增益也算进展）。
fn is_no_progress_text(t: &str) -> bool {
    t.starts_with("工具执行失败")
        || t.starts_with("no-op")
        || t.contains("未变化")
        || t.contains("未修改")
}
```

Also layout no-op message disambiguation in tools.rs:
- "no-op：几何无需调整。" → "no-op：目标坐标与现状一致，几何未变。若仍想移动请给出不同的绝对坐标；若满意请继续下一步。"
- "no-op：内容与当前文件相同，未修改。" → "no-op：替换文本与现状一致，文件未变。若仍想修改请给出不同的内容；若满意请继续下一步。"

Also apply_edits report.noop in edit: tools.rs edit path has same "no-op：内容与当前文件相同，未修改。" messages (3 places: draw/whole, edit batch, layout). Update all with clearer wording. Let me grep.

