Also worth checking: WHY does the model lose the protocol at turn ~4? Look at context: history grows with tool results; system prompt is FIRST message. Long context + flash model → protocol drift. An additional mitigation: re-inject the protocol reminder in the correction message (already done). Not much else to do cheaply.

